      <td>A producer MUST create immutable snapshots. A consumer MUST retrieve and validate snapshots in accordance with [Record validation](#subsection-record-validation).</td>
      <td>A producer MUST create immutable snapshots. A consumer MUST retrieve and validate snapshots in accordance with [Record  validation](#subsection-record-validation).</td>
